meta {
  name: CREATE
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

body:multipart-form {
  title: Contoh Post Sosial Media
  category_id: 1
  content: <p>Caption opsional bila source_url diisi.</p>
  source_url: https://www.tiktok.com/@gudangpeluru.45/video/7539789048500571400
  image: ~
  metadata: ~
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  Multipart form. Buat post baru.

  **Body (multipart):**
  - `title` (string, required, unique)
  - `category_id` (int, required)
  - `content` (text) — required jika `source_url` kosong; optional jika ada `source_url`
  - `source_url` (string, optional) — URL TikTok / YouTube (termasuk Shorts) / Instagram (post atau reel). Bila diisi, server otomatis isi `embed_provider` dan response berisi object `embed`.
  - `image` (file) — required jika `source_url` kosong; optional jika ada `source_url` (JPG/PNG, max 2MB).
  - `metadata` (JSON string, optional) — extras per-kategori. Untuk post Tanaman, isi dengan `{"nama_latin":"Capsicum frutescens","kategori_tanaman":"sayuran","musim_tanam":"sepanjang_tahun","hari_panen_min":75,"hari_panen_max":90,"tingkat_kesulitan":"sedang","kebutuhan_sinar":"penuh","kondisi_tumbuh":{"ph_min":5.5,"ph_max":6.8,"suhu_min":18,"suhu_max":30},"hama_umum":["thrips","kutu daun"]}`. Kirim sebagai *string JSON* di multipart body; server akan decode + simpan sebagai JSON. Null untuk post lain.

  **Provider yang didukung untuk `source_url`:**
  - `tiktok` — `https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/<id>` → embed: `https://www.tiktok.com/embed/v2/<id>`
  - `youtube` — `watch?v=<id>`, `youtu.be/<id>`, `shorts/<id>` → embed: `https://www.youtube.com/embed/<id>`
  - `instagram` — `/p/<code>`, `/reel/<code>`, `/tv/<code>` → embed: `https://www.instagram.com/<type>/<code>/embed/`
}
